    BRANCH
        IF `the person is a nominated officer acting on behalf of A, B or C` OR `the person is an employee, officer or partner of A, B or C`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "References in this section to A, B or C include—"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

