        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A relevant disclosure made in good faith does not breach" (a disclosure not made in good faith is not said to breach anything)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:311 | (2) But a relevant disclosure may not include information obtained from a UK law enforcement agency unless that agency consents to the disclosure.
