        IF `the disclosure is made to a constable in connection with a suspicion that a person is involved in the commission of a terrorist financing offence`
           AND `it is made for the purposes of avoiding the commission of an offence under s 21A by virtue of not satisfying the third condition in s 21A(4)`
            THEN JUST TRUE
